Content-Length: 89

{
  "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:M1",
  "name": "m1",
  "type": [
    "Building",
    "Shop"
  ]
}



12. GET M1?type=Shop;Vehicle - Vehicle is not one of its types: 404
===================================================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 159

{
  "detail": "entity 'urn:ngsi-ld:M1' not found",
  "status": 404,
