}



13. GET M1/attrs/name?type=Vehicle: 404
=======================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 159

{
  "detail": "entity 'urn:ngsi-ld:M1' not found",
  "status": 404,
  "title": "Not Found",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/ResourceNotFound"
}



14. GET M1/attrs/name/value?type=Shop: 200
==========================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 4

"m1"


--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
